_92k","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p001","chapter_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:p001","text":"孔子曰：「導之以政，齊之以刑，民免而無恥。導之以德，齊之以禮，有恥且格。」老氏稱：「上德不德，是以有德；下德不失德，是以無德。法令滋章，盜賊多有。」太史公曰：信哉是言也！法令者治之具，而非制治淸濁之源也。昔天下之網嘗密矣，然姦偽萌起，其極也，上下相遁，至於不振。當是之時，吏治若救火揚沸，非武健嚴酷，惡能勝其任而愉快乎！言道德者，溺其職矣。故曰「聽訟，吾猶人也，必也使無訟乎」。「下士聞道大笑之」。非虚言也。漢興，破觚而爲圜，斲雕而爲樸，網漏於呑舟之魚，而吏治烝烝，不至於姦，黎民艾安。由是觀之，在彼不在此。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m001-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"454_6ar_92k","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m001-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"老氏","kind":"person","person_id":"leu_lia_ldo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-122-kuli:m001-0074","start":74,"end":77,"surface":"太史公","kind":"person","person_id":"42d_lp1_gxc","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli","book_id":"b-shiji-122","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji122-kuli"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-122-kuli","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-122","source_id":"s-shiji122-kuli","source":{"title":"史記／卷122","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷122","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷122&oldid=7904124","revision_id":7904124,"accessed_on":"2026-10-11","extent":"固定修訂全文44段，包括末段索隱述贊。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署名及固定版本。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","normalization":{"character_conversion":{},"editorial_readings":[],"extraction_note":"去header2及現代節標、字形控制外殼而保留其中原字與異文；未核影像。","note":"末段索隱述贊分層，太史公論贊屬篇文。"}}}],"time_policy":{"unknown_is_not_unbounded":true,"attestation_is_no